<translation id="1388276868779258475">Chromium ilovasi bilan internetda kezishni istalgan joyda davom ettiring</translation>
<translation id="141901961143729572">Fikr-mulohaza qoldiring</translation>
<translation id="8789809509510733987">Oynani ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Agent Chrome brauzeriga ekranni yozib olish uchun ruxsat bering.</translation>
