<translation id="6877155553248388166">qidiruv hududining pastki oʻng burchagi: oʻng <ph name="RIGHT" />%, past <ph name="BOTTOM" />%</translation>
<translation id="6896758677409633944">Nusxa olish</translation>
<translation id="6898028264630240901">Internetni kezish davomida savollar berish uchun Kontekstli vazifalarni qadashingiz mumkin</translation>
<translation id="6901631050894301805">Chromiumni birlamchi brauzer etib tayinlang va vazifalar paneliga mahkamlang</translation>
